g>Platformu Keşfet</button></a></div></div><div class=\"relative lg:ml-10 z-10 [perspective:1000px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95) rotateX(10deg)\"><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-500/20 backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transform-gpu\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/5 bg-slate-950\"><img alt=\"SientoOps Platform Dashboard Preview\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-90 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1611162617474-5b21e879e113%3Fq%3D80%26w%3D2000%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-play w-6 h-6 text-indigo-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 9.003a1 1 0 0 1 1.517-.859l4.997 2.997a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.718l-4.997 2.997A1 1 0 0 1 9 14.996z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center\"><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white\">Video Düzenleme 101</div><div class=\"text-xs text-indigo-300\">İzlenmeye Hazır</div></div></div><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold border border-emerald-500/20 backdrop-blur-md\">%100 Tamamlandı</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"py-24 relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Neden SientoOps?</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">İçerik üreticiliği serüveninizde ihtiyacınız olan tüm modern araçları ve interaktif eğitim materyallerini tek bir çatı altında topladık.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start text-left h-full\"><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 mb-6 ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-play w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M9 9.003a1 1 0 0 1 1.517-.859l4.997 2.997a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.718l-4.997 2.997A1 1 0 0 1 9 14.996z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3\">Video Eğitimleri</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Sıfırdan ileri seviyeye kadar özel olarak hazırlanmış, 4K kalitesinde profesyonel video serileri ile kendi hızınızda öğrenin.</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-teal-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start text-left h-full\"><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 mb-6 ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3\">PDF Dokümanları</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Dersleri pekiştirmenizi sağlayacak detaylı notlar, kontrol listeleri ve sektörel şablonları anında cihazınıza indirin.</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-fuchsia-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start text-left h-full\"><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 mb-6 ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-monitor-play w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.033 9.44a.647.647 0 0 1 0 1.12l-4.065 2.352a.645.645 0 0 1-.968-.56V7.648a.645.645 0 0 1 .967-.56z\"></path><path d=\"M12 17v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h8\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3\">Workshoplar</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Gerçek hayat senaryoları üzerinden ilerleyen uygulamalı workshoplar ile teoriyi pratiğe dökme şansı yakalayın.</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 